[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025672\">7005E12</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections for the door mirror.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Driver&#x27;s external rear view mirror</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024652\">P60</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Exterior passenger side rear view mirror</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024655\">P61</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the sound inslation.</p><p>3. Undo the bolts securing the door mirror.</p><p>4. Remove the door mirror.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005152.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the door mirror\nis not damaged.</p><p>Fit the door mirror and tighten its bolts.</p><p>Place the sound insulation in position.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection</p><p>Check that the door mirror is working properly.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025672\">7005E12</a></p>"]]